      "**Implication:** USO Underweight conviction strengthens to High; long re-entry zone moves DOWN to $95 to $105 conditional on confirmed truce signing (was $115 to $120). Tactical short via puts that was put on 5/6 is now likely 50%+ in profit; close at the 50-75% target trigger. Most importantly: **the geopolitical tail risk that we listed as one of three regime-breaking conditions is now de-risking, not escalating.** That removes a potential downside catalyst from the broader equity book.",
